{"product_id":"awkward-to-awesome-my-guide-to-being-confident-dealing-with-hate-and-getting-through-puberty","title":"Awkward To Awesome: My guide to being confident, dealing with hate and getting through puberty!","description":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone feels awkward at least once in their life. Growing up, you feel it even more.Mia Fizz is a fifteen-year-old social media star with over 100 million views on her YouTube channel (Mia's Life). She's featured in numerous magazines, interviewed stars such as Mark Wahlberg (awkwardly!) and appeared in a sell-out live show alongside her family.This hilarious guide and memoir features Mia's own drawings and handwriting, never-before-seen pictures, and an empowering message that will help anyone who has ever felt shy, unconfident or awkward to grow beyond these feelings and live their best life.Also featuring an exclusive interview with fellow social media star, Mia's sister, Super Sienna (who featured on UK's Little Big Shots presented by Dawn French), plus a fun quiz, hairstyle tutorials and easy vegan recipes, this book will be any young persons go-to to take their life to the next level!Check out Mia's social medias here:YouTube: https: \/\/m.YouTube.com\/MiasLifeInstagram: https: \/\/www.instagram.com\/miaslifeofficial\/?hl=en\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mia Fizz\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781916300408\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 232\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472847560857,"sku":"10RA9781916300408","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff26fdc9d2-Awkward-To-Awesome-My-guide-to-being-confident-dealing-with-hate-and-getting-throu_5480_1.jpg?v=1753121417","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/awkward-to-awesome-my-guide-to-being-confident-dealing-with-hate-and-getting-through-puberty","provider":"Dubai - Buy U